(Corridor Agreement: terms of the one-year grain arrangement) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] The Realm Trade Ministry publishes this summary of the Corridor Agreement) Tj
T*
(for the guidance of exporters and shippers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The agreement was signed on 10 September 2025 and ran for one year. It) Tj
T*
(covered wheat and maize shipped by sea from Orvan Grain Port.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] Asgard mediated the agreement. While it was in force, sea exports from) Tj
T*
(Orvan ran at about 95% of the old normal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P4] The agreement dealt only with the sea corridor. Rail movements and sales by) Tj
T*
(other exporters were outside it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P5] The summary is issued in the ministry's usual form and is intended for) Tj
T*
(shippers who need the standing terms in one place. It repeats the text that) Tj
T*
(exporters have worked under since the agreement took effect. Questions about a) Tj
T*
(particular cargo should go to the customs office that handles the port, not to) Tj
T*
(the mediation team. The ministry will keep the summary on file after the) Tj
T*
(agreement ends, because contracts signed while it was in force still refer to) Tj
T*
(it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P6] This summary is issued for record. It does not change customs duties,) Tj
T*
(quality rules or the general law on grain sales.) Tj
T*
() Tj
